 "blocks": {
  "p1": [
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "A Period Tracker Designed Around Athletic Performance",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Role:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " UX/UI Designer · Developer · Team Coordinator",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Course:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " Introduction to iOS Development, UTS",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_3",
    "heading_3": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Overview",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "PeriodT is an athlete-focused period tracking concept designed to help athletes understand how their menstrual cycle may interact with ",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": "training, recovery and performance",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": ".",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "The project was developed within a two-week development period and combined interaction design with software development.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "divider",
    "divider": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "01 — The Challenge",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Traditional period trackers primarily focus on menstrual health and cycle prediction.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "For athletes, however, the menstrual cycle can also intersect with:",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Training",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Energy levels",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Recovery",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Exercise",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Performance",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "The goal was to explore how menstrual information could be presented in a way that was more relevant to an athlete's training routine.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "02 — Research & Team Planning",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Because the project focused on a problem space I was personally familiar with as an athlete, I was able to bring contextual knowledge into the research and ideation process.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "At the beginning of the project, I worked with my team to identify individual strengths, interests and development goals.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "We then allocated responsibilities across the project based on these strengths while maintaining shared ownership of the final product.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "03 — Low-Fidelity Design",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "With less than two weeks to complete the project, another team member and I rapidly developed the initial low-fidelity prototype.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "We established the core user flows before refining the concept into a mid-fidelity design.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "I took responsibility for reviewing the mid-fidelity experience and ensuring that the interactions and visual hierarchy remained consistent across the product.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "04 — Product Development",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_3",
    "heading_3": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Translating the design into a working product",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Once the core screens were confirmed, the team divided the development workload across the main product flows:",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Onboarding questionnaire",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Cycle home screen",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Calendar",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Predicted period",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Workout and exercise information",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "I contributed to the software development process and worked with the team through GitHub to combine and integrate our individual components.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "This required us to maintain consistency between the design and the implemented product while working within a highly compressed timeline.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "05 — Final Product",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "The final concept provided athletes with cycle-related information alongside training and exercise guidance.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "The experience was designed to help users move beyond simply ",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": "predicting their period",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " towards understanding how their cycle could be considered within their broader training routine.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_2",
    "heading_2": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Outcome",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_3",
    "heading_3": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "🏆 Best Interaction Design — TechFest",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "PeriodT was selected as the Best Interaction Design project from 40 selected projects and 200+ applicants.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "I also completed the course with a High Distinction.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Following the project, PeriodT received interest from industry and is currently being explored for further development.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "heading_3",
    "heading_3": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "What I brought to the project",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Product thinking:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " Connected menstrual-cycle tracking with the specific needs of athletes.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "UX/UI:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " Contributed to the core interaction flows and visual design.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Development:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " Contributed to implementing the product and integrating team code through GitHub.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Team coordination:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " Helped allocate development responsibilities according to team strengths and project requirements.",
       "annotations": {},
       "href": null
      }
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
     "rich_text": [
      {
       "plain_text": "Outcome:",
       "annotations": {
        "bold": true
       },
       "href": null
      },
      {
       "plain_text": " Delivered an award-winning interaction design concept within a two-week development period.",
       "annotations": {},
